386
00:25:58,303 --> 00:25:59,703
<font color=#FFFF00>Você descobriu algo.</font>

387
00:26:00,931 --> 00:26:02,393
<font color=#FFFF00>Parzival, conte!</font>

388
00:26:05,923 --> 00:26:07,423
<i><b>Roubam<font color=#FF0000> e monetizam
<font color=#00FF00>legendas</font> do</font> <font color=#FF0000>L</font><font color=#00FF00>T</font><font color=#00FFFF>V</font></b></i>

389
00:27:43,180 --> 00:27:45,326
