394
00:28:23,304 --> 00:28:25,055
<font color=#FFFF00>PLACAR
1 - PARZIVAL - 100 MIL PONTOS</font>

395
00:28:25,056 --> 00:28:28,791
<font color=#FFFF00>Quem é esse Parzival
