429
00:30:02,717 --> 00:30:04,814
<font color=#FFFF00>20 mil pela Santa Granada?</font>

430
00:30:05,402 --> 00:30:06,831
<font color=#FFFF00>É uma pechincha.</font>

431
00:30:10,483 --> 00:30:12,130
<font color=#FFFF00>Um cubo Zemeckis.</font>

432
00:30:12,131 --> 00:30:15,089
<font color=#FFFF00>- Preciso de um desses.
