433
00:30:18,609 --> 00:30:20,967
<font color=#FFFF00>Traje háptico X1?</font>

434
00:30:22,111 --> 00:30:23,808
<font color=#FFFF00>ENTREGAS NO MUNDO REAL</font>

435
00:30:35,688 --> 00:30:37,408
<font color=#FFFF00>Aí, sim.</font>

436
00:30:52,306 --> 00:30:53,750
<font color=#FFFF00><i>SENHA:
Jefazo69</i></font>

437
00:31:30,169 --> 00:31:33,381
<font color=#FFFF00>I-R0k.
