501
00:35:20,905 --> 00:35:24,768
<font color=#FFFF00>DIÁRIOS DE HALLIDAY</font>

502
00:35:28,149 --> 00:35:29,549
<font color=#FFFF00>Vejam, é Parzival!</font>

503
00:35:30,689 --> 00:35:32,541
<font color=#FFFF00><i>Parzival, meu herói!</i></font>

504
00:35:45,414 --> 00:35:46,814
