521
00:37:07,205 --> 00:37:08,813
<font color=#FFFF00>Vejam isso.</font>

522
00:37:09,123 --> 00:37:10,523
<font color=#FFFF00>Sabe quem é?</font>

523
00:37:12,401 --> 00:37:14,129
<font color=#FFFF00>É Sorrento?</font>

524
00:37:14,130 --> 00:37:16,007
<font color=#FFFF00>Sorrento começou
